[ti:Poor Ian!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.91]Lesson 91 | 第91课
[00:03.45]Poor Ian! | 可怜的伊恩!
[00:06.26]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.13]Who wanted to sell the house? | 谁想卖房子?
[00:17.55]Has Ian sold his house yet? | 伊恩已经把他的房子卖掉了吗?
[00:21.25]Yes, he has. | 是的,他卖掉了。
[00:23.21]He sold it last week. | 他上周卖掉的。
[00:26.92]Has he moved to his new house yet? | 他搬进新房子了吗?
[00:31.45]No, not yet. | 不,还没有。
[00:33.81]He's still here. | 他还住在这儿。
[00:36.05]He's going to move tomorrow. | 他打算明天搬。
[00:39.82]When? Tomorrow morning? | 什么时候?明天上午?
[00:44.12]No. Tomorrow afternoon. | 不。明天下午。
[00:47.83]I'll miss him. | 我会想念他的。
[00:49.89]He has always been a good neighbour. | 他一直是个好邻居。
[00:54.57]He's a very nice person. | 他是一个非常不错的人。
[00:58.17]We'll all miss him. | 我们都会想念他。
[01:02.21]When will the new people move into this house? | 新房客什么时候搬进这房子?
[01:07.54]I think that they'll move in the day after tomorrow. | 我想他们后天会搬进来。
[01:14.22]Will you see Ian today, Jenny? | 珍妮,你今天会见到伊恩吗?
[01:19.71]Yes, I will. | 是的,我会见到他。
[01:23.09]Please give him my regards. | 请代我向他问好。
[01:27.83]Poor Ian! He didn't want to leave this house. | 可怜的伊恩!他不想离开这房子。
[01:34.49]No, he didn't want to leave, but his wife did! | 是的,他不想离开,但他妻子想!